## FFmpeg

No FFmpeg binary is committed to this repository. Windows release installers
may bundle the pinned `ffmpeg 9.0 essentials` archive obtained by the build
workflow from Gyan.dev or its Gyan GitHub mirror. The build verifies the
archive SHA-256 before extraction.

Every release that bundles FFmpeg must include the license and notice files
shipped in the exact FFmpeg archive used for that release, together with its
source URL, version, and archive SHA-256. The release attestation records
these values; see `tools/ffmpeg/README.md` and
`docs/release-artifact-attestation-template.md`.

